<title>FRANCE: IBCA maintains Credit Agricole rating.</title>
<headline>IBCA maintains Credit Agricole rating.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>European rating agency IBCA said it maintained the rating of Credit Agricole at A1+ and AA+ following its acquisition of 100 percent of Banque Indoseuz from Cie Financiere de Suez</p>
<p>The Indosuez ratings were also maintained unchanged at A1+ and AA-.</p>
</text>
